Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Every single lonely night, the young boy desperately wished time would just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.38,0:00:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then one strange afternoon, his impossible wish actually came true in total silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He could suddenly freeze everything around him including heavy rain and moving people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.61,0:00:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,At first, wielding this incredible cosmic power made him feel like an almighty god.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.27,0:00:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He easily used his amazing gift to win every fight and avoid all pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.48,0:00:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Slowly, a deeply terrifying realization began to dawn on his troubled young mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.50,0:00:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time time stopped, someone he truly loved permanently forgot a memory of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.12,0:00:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,First his best friend forgot their childhood, and then his loving mother forgot his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.66,0:00:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Deeply desperate, he stopped time one final time and whispered his heartbreaking truth aloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He let time flow again, choosing to finally grow older instead of living forever.
